# Copy to .env (git-ignored), then fill in the values in your editor.
# Never commit .env, and never paste a key into a chat, an issue or a notebook cell.
# The CLI loads .env at start-up; a variable already set in your terminal takes precedence.

# --- OpenAI API (gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18) -------------------------------------------------------
# Used only for docs/NEXT_PLAN.md v3 § 2, all on text the project wrote itself:
#   U1  H7 reference: gpt-4o-mini scored on challenge set v1 (about USD 0.05)
#         vifeedback study llm-reference --backend openai --model gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18 --data challenge
#   U2  label check of challenge v1: rows both LLMs disagree with go on a list for a person to review
#   U3  teencode spelling candidates for common words; a person accepts or rejects each one
#   U4  off-topic development sentences for the out-of-scope score
#   U5  a router measurement, only if the declared H7 runs justify it
# Never used for gold labels, for UIT-VSFC text (until its licence is confirmed), or when serving.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Hugging Face -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: higher Hub download limits, and `vifeedback serve publish --repo-id ... --upload`.
HF_TOKEN=
